  unitName: Crashing Bolt Rutheon
  unitId: 40414
  unitNumber: 1290
  description: Rutheon was imprisoned for the murders of an entire squad of Federation
    soldiers. One day, a government official proposed to pardon Rutheon's crimes
    in exchange for participating in an expeditionary mission into Ishgria. Rutheon
    showed no interest or emotion, until he heard of the fiendish beasts that inhabit
    Ishgria. When meeting the others, Rutheon gave only his name, then never said
    another word, staring down anyone who met his gaze.
  summonDesc: I remember only the pride of my tribe. I will not be defeated, not
    here, not to anyone.
  fusionDesc: I cannot begin to guess what you intend. But, I shall accept this power.
    I need the strength to fight.
  evoDesc: Adapt, or die.<br>This is the way of nature.<br>The crueler the environment,<br>the
    truer this becomes.
  element: 4
  rarity: 4
